# Build/test artefacts staged for the laptop and for releases (2026-08-17).
# ~180 MB of installers and portable trees across these folders. They are BUILD OUTPUT — the
# distribution policy is to ship them as release assets, not to carry them in git history, where
# they can never be removed without a rewrite.
/build-0*/
/artifacts/
